paper.pdf is the locally retained arXiv v3 GRU author version with appendices.
references/FactorGCL-paper.pdf and references/FactorGCL-appendix.pdf are original
reference documents with their original copyright notices preserved. The MIT
license for this independent implementation does not relicense any of these PDFs.
Consult the original publishers/rightsholders for their applicable terms.

The software reproduces a financial GRU baseline on forward-adjusted A-share daily data, not the original
machine-translation system or its BLEU experiments. Its PyTorch reset-after GRU
differs from the reset-before encoder equations in the original GRU paper.
The architecture and data substitutions are disclosed in both READMEs.

No market/industry inputs, stock-level predictions with actual labels/returns,
SSH credentials, deployment tools, or internal research reports are distributed.
The software license grants no rights to third-party market or industry data.
